      "action_label": "June 1, 2026 Krista Newkirk President University of Redlands 1200 East Colton Ave PO Box 3080 Redlands, CA 92373-0999 Jeff Bellantoni President Woodbury University 7500 North Glenoaks Boulevard Burbank, CA 91504 Dear Presidents Newkirk and Bellantoni: During its May 29, 2026 meeting, the WASC Senior College and University Commission (WSCUC) considered a proposal submitted by University of Redlands (Redlands) and Woodbury University (Woodbury) for a merger of the two institutions following a Change of Control of Woodbury to Redlands in 2024, which was the first step of a two-step process in accordance with federal regulations pertaining to mergers of institutions.",
